# Replays on the procedural UI system. Title top-left, the replay list in one panel with Load / Copy / Delete stacked at
# its right, Back in the bottom bar. GadgetParent and the unnamed box around the list hold the controls, so both are made
# to cover them and draw nothing. Units: 1 = frame height / 1080.
hide $ParentReplayMenu
window $GadgetParent left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide $GadgetParent
window parent:$ListboxReplayFiles left top 0 0 1920 1080
hide parent:$ListboxReplayFiles
hide $Line

window text:GUI:LoadReplay left top 64 40 560 48 title
ruler left top 64 94 560

panel left top 64 124 1792 832
window $ListboxReplayFiles left top 84 150 1340 780 list
window $ButtonLoadReplay left top 1456 150 380 44 primary
window $ButtonCopyReplay left top 1456 210 380 44 button
window $ButtonDeleteReplay left top 1456 270 380 44 danger

window $ButtonBack left bottom 64 40 180 44 button
